<title>USA: Williams Communications chief to retire.</title>
<headline>Williams Communications chief to retire.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Williams Communications Group Inc said Henry C. &quot;Harry&quot; Hirsch has announced he plans to retire as vice chairman and chief executive officer at the end of this month.</p>
<p>Williams Cos Inc said Howard E. Janzen, president and chief operating officer of its communications group, will assume Hirsch's responsibilities in addition to his current duties.  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
